  <img class="file-icon" src="/themes/custom/eindhoven/img/widgets/link-icons/link-icon-pdf.svg" alt="PDF bestand" />  <a href="https://www.openeindhoven.nl/sites/default/files/2025-11/Wandeling%20Flora%20en%20fauna%20op%20Landgoed%20de%20Wielwaal%20ENG.pdf" type="application/pdf; length=3547613" target="_blank">Wandeling Flora en fauna op Landgoed de Wielwaal - English</a> <span>(3.38 MB)</span>
