  <img class="file-icon" src="/themes/custom/eindhoven/img/widgets/link-icons/link-icon-pdf.svg" alt="PDF bestand" />  <a href="https://www.openeindhoven.nl/sites/default/files/2025-11/Wandeling%20De%20erfenis%20van%20Philips%20op%20Landgoed%20de%20Wielwaal.pdf" type="application/pdf; length=3071830" target="_blank">Wandeling De erfenis van Philips op Landgoed de Wielwaal</a> <span>(2.93 MB)</span>
